{
 "priority": 2,
 "source_bins": [
  "sound_auth.bin",
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Okay. I found the blueprints.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Hm?)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Looks like you need a key to get to the stairs\non the third floor.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(I won't be able to get to the room Murase's in.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Gotta find a key somehow.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(This is the security room, so the key might be around here.\nI should take a look around.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(What's this?)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Guess the key's in this room somewhere.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(No idea where, though.\nI'll have to look for it.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(A safe, huh...?)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(The note on the desk said to keep the key\n\"under high security.\")</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Not much higher security than a safe.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Let's see here...)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Damn, I need the code.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Hmm... hopefully there's a clue to the password\nsomewhere around here...)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Wait, is this...)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Is this the code to the safe?)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Well, worth a shot...)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Dammit, guess not. Better keep looking.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Whoa! It worked!)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Great... This'll get me through to Murase.\nNow I just have to find him.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Maybe this is the code to the safe?)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Guess not... What's this code for, then?)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(I'll try and memorize it just in case.\nBound to be a password for something.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Where have I seen her before...?)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Hey, it's the smoking lady!\nFrom when I was looking for Kaito-san!)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(...Can't blame her, if she works at a stressful place like this.\nThose smoke breaks probably get her through the day.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(I got the safe open.\nTime to get moving.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Guess it wasn't the code to that safe.\nMaybe it'll come in handy somewhere else.)</color>": "",
  "Hi there. I heard you're having some heater\ntrouble? I'm here to fix it.": "",
  "Hi there. I heard you're having some\ntrouble with air conditioning?": "",
  "Yes, it seems to have stopped.\nThank you for coming on such short notice.": "",
  "Thank you for coming on such short notice.\nWe need our central air fixed.": "",
  "The main unit is just out the door to the left,\nright around the emergency stairwell.": "",
  "The main unit is just outside.\nYou can find the door on the left.": "",
  "Um, mind if I take a look at an indoor unit\nas well? These things can be pretty complicated.": "",
  "Well, mind if I take a look at an indoor unit as well?\nI want to make sure I know the whole situation.": "",
  "Is that really necessary sir?": "",
  "You need to see... an indoor unit?": "",
  "It'll help me get a better idea of the whole system.\nI'd... rather not bore you with the specifics.": "",
  "Yeah, 'cause... it'll help me get a better idea of the whole system.\nI'd... rather not bore you with the specifics.": "",
  "Very well then. Sure.\nThere's one in the security office to your left.": "",
  "Is that so...? Well, there's a security office\nto your left.": "",
  "Thank you very much.\nI'll have you guys heated up in no time.": "",
  "I appreciate it. Anyway, I'll let you\nget back to your work...": "",
  "(Bingo.)": "",
  "(I should check out the security office first,\nget some more info on the building.)": "",
  "(I shouldn't get too close to those guys.\nDon't want them getting suspicious.)": "",
  "(Looks like the elevator's down for maintenance.\nI'll have to use the fire escape to head up.)": "",
  "(Looks like I'm the only one here.\nHave to get in and out before someone shows up.)": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(It's dark... I need to turn on the lights before\nI can look for the blueprints for the building.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Which means unless I get that key,\nI can't get to Murase...)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Gotta find the key somehow.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Well, this <font_kind=yakuza_italic>is</font_kind> the security room. Maybe the key's in here.\nI should take a look around.)\n": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(The key's gotta be in this room somewhere.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(But where would it be...?\nI better get searching.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Not much higher security than a safe.)": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Damn, I need the code.)": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Is this the code to the safe?)": "",
  "(All right, time to head for the fire escape.\nShould be just to the left of this room.)": "",
  "(Still broken, and no real repairman in sight.\nSorry, pal. I don't think you're getting fixed today.)": "",
  "Just the guy I was lookin' for!": "",
  "Whoa, just the guy I was lookin' for!": "",
  "You're here to fix the heat, yeah?\nGot somethin' I need you to check out.": "",
  "Hey, chief. You're here to fix the heat, yeah?\nGot somethin' I need you to check out.": "",
  "Oh, sure. No problem!": "",
  "Uh, yes! Of course, sir!": "",
  "C'mon. This way.": "",
  "(Shoot. I don't have a choice.)": "",
  "Hey, where ya going?\nIt's over this way!": "",
  "Hey, where you goin'!?\nGet over here!": "",
  "Whew, I'm freezin' my balls off, man.\nHope this goes quick.": "",
  "Geez, that's cold...\nWe're freezing our asses off, see.": "",
  "Uh, right.": "",
  "(I should probably follow him.)": "",
  "There it is. The power's on and all,\nbut nothing's happenin'.": "",
  "Yep, there it is. The power's on and all,\nbut nothing's happenin'.": "",
  "Okay, lemme see what I can do.": "",
  "Okay, got it. Let me take a look.": "",
  "(I can't believe I'm doing this...)": "",
  "Yuuuup, this thing's\nseen better days.": "",
  "Aha... Yep, it's definitely broken.": "",
  "Thanks, Sherlock.\nCan ya fix it?": "",
  "Yeah, so fuckin' fix it.": "",
  "(Man, I have no idea how to fix\na goddamn air conditioner.)": "",
  "Hey genius, if you're gonna fix it,\ndon't you need to take the panel off first?": "",
  "Wait, you're gonna fix it like that?\nDon't you gotta take the panel off?": "",
  "(No choice now but to go all in!)": "",
  "(I can't give up now. One more try!)": "",
  "Well ain't that something!\nNever realized it was that simple!": "",
  "Whoa, ain't that something!\nNever realized it was that simple.": "",
  "Glad I could be of service. Now if you'll excuse me,\nI have other repairs to make.": "",
  "Oh, it's fine. Just glad I could be of service.\nNow, I'd better get going...": "",
  "(Phew. That was a close one.)": "",
  "Huh? Who're you?": "",
  "Huh? Who's this?": "",
  "Oh, I'm... here to repair the heater, sir.": "",
  "Uh... I'm here to repair the heater, sir.": "",
  "Weird. You ain't the usual guy.": "",
  "(They have a \"usual guy\"...?\nHow often do their heaters break down?)": "",
  "Where's our man, huh?\nNever had anyone else come for us.": "",
  "What happened to our maintenance guy, huh?\nNever had anyone else come for us.": "",
  "Oh, uh... About that.": "",
  "Y'know what, I'll just give him\nanother call. See what's up for myself.": "",
  "Y'know what... I'll just give him another call.\nSee what's going on here for myself.": "",
  "(So he's the one who put the call in.\nHow can I get myself out of this?)": "",
  "Oh, the guy we normally send out here is sick\ntoday. I'm handling things in his place.": "",
  "Oh, the usual guy is sick today.\nI'm handling things in his place.": "",
  "Funny, I just got off the phone with him.\nSounded an awful lot like he was on his way over.": "",
  "What? I just got off the phone with him.\nFrom the way I heard it, he was already on his way.": "",
  "That's odd. He must have...\ngotten better, I guess.": "",
  "Huh? That's odd...\nHe must have gotten better, I guess...": "",
  "(Dammit, he talked to the guy on the phone!\nI should've come up with something better!)": "",
  "This guy's suspicious as shit!\nI bet he's a Tojo spy!": "",
  "Oh shit, you're right!\nCome on, boys. Let's take him down!": "",
  "Oh shit! Come on, boys!\nLet's take him down!": "",
  "I'm actually from Kamuro Maintenance, Sir.\nHave you heard of us? We're small, but uh... growing?": "",
  "I'm not sure. Maybe you called two repairmen?\nI'm with a company called Kamuro Maintenance.": "",
  "...Can't say that I have.\nMust be new in town.": "",
  "Kamuro Maintenance...?\nCan't say I know 'em.": "",
  "I guess someone else put the call in, then.\nSorry, Sir. I didn't mean to startle you.": "",
  "Well then, I'm terribly sorry about this.\nI suppose someone else called me in.": "",
  "Nah, it's all right.\nMakes sense why I wouldn't recognize you.": "",
  "Nah, s'okay. Makes sense I wouldn't recognize you.\nNo wonder, right?": "",
  "We fix it or your money back, sir!": "",
  "Thank you, sir.\nFeel free to call us again!": "",
  "(Phew, tricked him.)": "",
  "(I can't keep hanging around here, though.\nGotta get moving.)": "",
  "The truth is...\nI got plastic surgery.": "",
  "Well... I got plastic surgery.": "",
  "You what?": "",
  "That's right. I wasn't comfortable in my own skin,\nso I saved up for years to finally go through with it.": "",
  "That's right. I was never comfortable in my own skin.\nI saved up for years to make this happen.": "",
  "And how do you explain your voice changin'?": "",
  "And how do you explain\nyour voice changin'?": "",
  "My voice?": "",
  "...Uh... my voice?": "",
  "It's totally different from how you sounded on the phone.\nYou're not gonna tell me your voice changed too, are you?": "",
  "(Phew, made it out. I should get moving\nbefore the whole building catches onto me.)": "",
  "(Doesn't look like this door'll open.)": "",
  "(Looks like it's locked...)": "",
  "(Wait, what about the \"third floor\" key I found\nin the security office?)": "",
  "(That just might do the trick.)": "",
  "(Hm? This door wasn't on the map...\nWhy are yakuza offices always so confusing?)": "",
  "(Either way, the key from before\nwon't work up here.)": "",
  "(Guess I'll just have to pick the lock.)": "",
  "(What the...? There aren't any stairs up.\nThis isn't the top floor, though.)": "",
  "(I need to find a way up to Murase!)": "",
  "(Sturdy door for a reception room.)": "",
  "(No way I'm getting in there\nwithout the code.)": "",
  "(Not that I need to get in anyway.\nMurase's my target here.)": "",
  "(I'll need a code to get in here.)": "",
  "(I think this was a warehouse.\nMight be something useful in there.)": "",
  "(Guess I'll try putting in a code.)": "",
  "(Hey, it opened.)": "",
  "(Well, that didn't work.)": "",
  "(Sounds like someone's\npretty pissed up there.)": "",
  "(I'll need to find a way around\nif I don't want to get caught.)": "",
  "(I can get out on the roof from here.)": "",
  "(...And there's my way up.)": "",
  "(The fire escape's just over there.\nMy way down to the fifth floor.)": "",
  "(Not sure what's going on, but those guys look busy.\nI should try and sneak around them if I can.)": "",
  "The fuck were you thinkin', dumbass!?": "",
  "You dumbass!\nThe fuck were you thinkin'!?": "",
  "We warned you this was\ngonna happen!": "",
  "Please, I'm sorry!\nI'm so sorry...!": "",
  "(Okay, now to climb this fence.)": "",
  "Just get the hell outta here!": "",
  "Huh? But...": "",
  "Huh? Kaito-san?": "",
  "Is that... Kaito-san?": "",
  "But I got a call\nabout a broken heater...": "",
  "But I got a call about a broken heater...": "",
  "I told you, we figured it out!\nAll fixed, nothing to see here!": "",
  "I told you, we figured it out!\nNo thanks to you!": "",
  "Can I at least check to make sure everything's okay?\nOh, and I'll need you to sign this, too.": "",
  "I'm not signing shit. You didn't even fix anything!\nNow get the hell outta here!": "",
  "I'm not signing shit, so get outta here!\nYou didn't even fix anything!": "",
  "Actually, could I borrow your restroom?\nI'm not feeling so good...": "",
  "Shit yourself for all I care!": "",
  "Then shit yourself!": "",
  "Whaaat!?": "",
  "(Almost there. Hold out a little\nlonger, Kaito-san!)": "",
  "What the hell're you after, huh?": "",
  "I already said, I just want to talk.\nLook at this.": "",
  "Weren't you listening? I just want to talk to you.\nLook at this.": "",
  "This is you running away\nafter abandoning Kume.": "",
  "Who do you think you are?": "",
  "The hell are you tryin' to say?": "",
  "I'm a local detective. Hamura's lawyer\nis having me look into Kume's murder.": "",
  "I'm a Kamurocho detective. I'm looking into Kume's murder,\non behalf of Hamura's lawyer.": "",
  "So what, you're defending Hamura?": "",
  "Lemme get this straight...\nYou're defending that asshole, Hamura?": "",
  "You think I'm gonna tell\nyou shit, asshole!?": "",
  "Go to hell!\nWhy should I tell you shit!?": "",
  "I thought we already negotiated.\nYou want to go again?": "",
  "I thought we already <font_kind=yakuza_italic>negotiated</font_kind>.\nYou want to go again?": "",
  "You're not gettin' out of this unscathed,\ny'know. I know your face now.": "",
  "You're not walking out of this unscathed,\ny'know. I know your face now.": "",
  "Do you really think Hamura killed Kume?": "",
  "'Course I do.\nWho else could've done it?": "",
  "That's what I'm trying to find out.\nI need to know what happened that night.": "",
  "That's what I'm trying to find out. If I can find\nthe right clues, I'll know for sure.": "",
  "Hmph, it's as clear as day.\nHamura gouged Kume's eyes out, end of story!": "",
  "Yeah? Where? How?": "",
  "In the dump behind Amour.\nBastard tortured Kume to death!": "",
  "Actually, the murder happened somewhere else.\nAnd I have the evidence to prove it.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(What do I have that can\nprove that...?)</color>": "",
  "Take a look at this.": "",
  "The hell're you playin' at?": "",
  "The hell does that mean?": "",
  "You sayin' he was killed\ninside Amour? I don't get it.": "",
  "You tryin' to say Kume died in Amour?\nI don't get it.": "",
  "Actually, uh... It's kinda hard\nto tell from this. Just a sec.": "",
  "Actually... good point. It's kinda hard to tell from this.\nJust a sec.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Kume's body was found behind Amour,\nbut the murder happened somewhere else.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(What do I have that can prove that...?)</color>": "",
  "As you can see here,\nthe security camera behind Amour is broken.": "",
  "There's a security camera behind Amour.\nBut take a close look: it's broken.": "",
  "And your point is?\nI'm not gettin' it.": "",
  "Okay? Who gives a shit?\nI'm not gettin' it.": "",
  "So what? I don't get it.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Hamura drove the owner of Amour outside.\nBut, I guess Murase himself isn't shown.)</color>": "",
  "(That's right. There's a hint\nin this picture.)": "",
  "(Kume's body was moved here after he died.\nThere was something in this picture that showed that.)": "",
  "(The corpse had its eyes gouged out,\nbut let's not touch on that now.)": "",
  "(The corpse of Toshiro Kume, a Kyorei Clan yakuza.\nNo point in telling Murase that, though.)": "",
  "(The garbage isn't important.)": "",
  "(What I need to show is that Kume was killed\nsomewhere else than this picture shows.)": "",
  "(If I recall correctly, they didn't find a wallet\nor phone in his pockets.)": "",
  "(No signs of blood on the ground.\nThat's it!)": "",
  "What the hell?\nThat's... Kume!": "",
  "Sorry, I'm sure this\nis tough to look at.": "",
  "Sorry if this is tough to look at.": "",
  "But as you can see, there's almost\nno blood around his body.": "",
  "But... it's pretty clear from the picture\nthat there's barely any blood around the body.": "",
  "That means he was killed somewhere else,\nthen transported to the alleyway.": "",
  "Oh... I guess so, huh?\nIt doesn't add up, does it?": "",
  "Huh, guess so...\nWell, I see what you mean...": "",
  "So. You ready to talk now?": "",
  "So, you ready to talk now?": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(I think I can finally get to\nthe main topic now.)</color>": "",
  "Okay, let's take it from the top.": "",
  "Now. After you ran away from Amour,\nwhere exactly did you go?": "",
  "You couldn't just let them\ntake Kume, could you?": "",
  "They took your buddy Kume.\nYou wouldn't take that lying down.": "",
  "Yeah. I had to do something.": "",
  "...I had to do somethin'.": "",
  "So I went to round up the rest of the clan.\nWe had to take Kume back.": "",
  "So I went to round up the boys.\nRally the Kyorei and take Kume back, see?": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Uh, right.": "เอ่อ ก็จริง",
  "Huh? Who're you?": "หา? นายเป็นใครน่ะ?",
  "You what?": "ว่าไงนะ?",
  "Whaaat!?": "ห๊าาา!?"
 }
}
